OL,3,GNEWSASouth braces for first named storm
OL,4,Aof the season
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across the South are
OL,7,Fbracing for the impact of Storm Austen.
OL,9,FThe first named storm of the UK's storm
OL,10,Fseason is forecast to bring strong
OL,11,Fwinds and heavy rain from Thursday
OL,12,Fnight, according to the Met Office.
OL,14,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,15,Fweather warning for wind for Dorset,
OL,16,Fthe Isle of Wight and parts of
OL,17,FHampshire which comes into effect at
OL,18,Fmidnight, while northern Hampshire,
OL,19,FBerkshire and Oxfordshire will be under
OL,20,Fa warning from 10:00 BST on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
