OL,3,GNEWSASouth braces for first named storm
OL,4,Aof the season
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services have urged people
OL,7,Facross the region to take care and
OL,8,Favoid unnecessary risks, while ferry
OL,9,Fsailings have been cancelled and some
OL,10,Fschools and businesses have announced
OL,11,Fplans to close.
